5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf, okay?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"It's a bit scary, but I'll do my best. I hope we can all get along.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Don't be so timid, Minato. We just need to be smart and brave to win this.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,I'm ready! I'll use my intuition to help everyone. This is going to be so much fun!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's keep our emotions in check. Logic is the only way to identify the wolf in this group.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're always so serious! Lighten up a bit! Who do you think looks suspicious already?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,I don't know... everyone seems normal to me right now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,It's too early to tell. We need to see how people react once the first night passes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,"I agree with Takumi. For now, let's just get to know each other's vibes!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, curiosity is fine, but jumping to conclusions is a mistake. I'm observing everyone's patterns.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, you're no fun! I'm just playing around. I wonder who the Seer is?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,I wonder... it must be hard to hold such a secret.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"The Seer should be careful. If they reveal themselves too early, the wolf will just eat them.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,That's true! The Seer has to be very strategic. I'll be cheering for them!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Precisely. The Seer's information is the village's greatest weapon. We must protect them.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to keep a close eye on everyone! This is like being a little detective!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minato,,I'll try to listen carefully to what everyone says tomorrow.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Just don't be too naive, Minato. Some people are better at lying than others.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm sure we'll figure it out together! Good luck tonight, everyone!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
