31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I had a weird dream about a big fluffy wolf!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning... I hope nobody was attacked. It's a bit frightening.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"We're all here, so no one died yet. Now the real game begins.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mio,,Everyone is safe! But I have some very important information from last night...,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, you're being quite bold. Are you planning to reveal your role already?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh! Is Mio the Seer? Tell us, tell us! Who did you check?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minato,,"If Mio is the Seer, that would be very helpful for us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Wait, if she reveals herself now, she's a target. Maybe she should be more discreet.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I can't keep it a secret! I checked Takumi, and he is the Werewolf!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"That was fast. @Takumi, what do you have to say for yourself?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,What?! Takumi is the wolf? No way! He looked so brave and cool!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I... I can't believe it. Takumi, is it true?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,What?! Mio is lying! She's the wolf trying to frame me to get me executed!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm not lying! I saw it clearly! You're the werewolf, Takumi!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,A direct clash. Either Mio is the Seer or she's a very aggressive Werewolf or Possessed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"This is so exciting! But if Mio is lying, she's a meanie! I'll vote for the wolf!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minato,,I trust Mio... she seems too honest to lie like that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Don't listen to her! She's tricking you all! I'm a human!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm telling the truth! Please, everyone, we have to vote for Takumi now!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The probability of the Seer lying is zero by definition. If Mio is the Seer, Takumi must go.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
